{"id": 2847, "title": "Boxer’s Mistake", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "boxers-mistake", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2847_boxers-mistake.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["身材高大的拳击手去饭馆吃饭，他脱下大衣挂在门上。因为害怕大衣被别人拿走，所以他在大衣上留下了一张纸条：”拳击手的大衣在此，我一会儿就回来。”然后就放心地去吃饭了。当他吃完去拿大衣时，发现大衣不见了，只留下了一张纸条，上面写着：”杰出的跑步运动员拿走了大衣，他不再回来了！”", "每个人都有自己的优点，你有的别人可能没有，别人有的你也未必有，不要总是盯着自己的长处而忽略了自己的不足，善于看到别人的长处和发现自己的不足也是很重要的。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["身材高大的拳擊手去飯館吃飯，他脫下大衣掛在門上。因為害怕大衣被別人拿走，所以他在大衣上留下了一張紙條：”拳擊手的大衣在此，我一會兒就回來。”然後就放心地去吃飯了。當他吃完去拿大衣時，發現大衣不見了，只留下了一張紙條，上面寫著：”傑出的跑步運動員拿走了大衣，他不再回來了！”", "每個人都有自己的優點，你有的別人可能沒有，別人有的你也未必有，不要總是盯著自己的長處而忽略了自己的不足，善於看到別人的長處和發現自己的不足也是很重要的。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["shēn cái gāo dà de quán jī shǒu qù fàn guǎn chī fàn， tā tuō xià dà yī guà zài mén shàng。 yīn wèi hài pà dà yī bèi bié rén ná zǒu， suǒ yǐ tā zài dà yī shàng liú xia le yī zhāng zhǐ tiáo：” quán jī shǒu de dà yī zài cǐ， wǒ yī huì r jiù huí lái。” rán hòu jiù fàng xīn de qù chī fàn le。 dāng tā chī wán qù ná dà yī shí， fā xiàn dà yī bù jiàn le， zhǐ liú xia le yī zhāng zhǐ tiáo， shàng miàn xiě zhe：” jié chū de pǎo bù yùn dòng yuán ná zǒu le dà yī， tā bù zài huí lái le！”", "měi gè rén dōu yǒu zì jǐ de yōu diǎn， nǐ yǒu de bié rén kě néng méi yǒu， bié rén yǒu de nǐ yě wèi bì yǒu， bù yào zǒng shì dīng zhe zì jǐ de cháng chù ér hū lüè le zì jǐ de bù zú， shàn yú kàn dào bié rén de cháng chù hé fā xiàn zì jǐ de bù zú yě shì hěn zhòng yào de。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A tall boxer went to a restaurant for a meal. He took off his coat and hung it by the door. Worried that someone might take it, he left a note on it: “This coat belongs to a boxer. I’ll be back soon.” Then he went to eat, confident his coat was safe. But when he finished and went to get it, the coat was gone. All that remained was a note saying, “An outstanding runner took the coat. He won’t be coming back!”", "Everyone has their own strengths. You may have strengths others lack, and others may have strengths you don’t. Don’t focus so much on what you’re good at that you overlook your weaknesses. It’s important to recognize other people’s strengths and your own shortcomings."], "english_full": "A tall boxer went to a restaurant for a meal. He took off his coat and hung it by the door. Worried that someone might take it, he left a note on it: “This coat belongs to a boxer. I’ll be back soon.” Then he went to eat, confident his coat was safe. But when he finished and went to get it, the coat was gone. All that remained was a note saying, “An outstanding runner took the coat. He won’t be coming back!”\n\nEveryone has their own strengths. You may have strengths others lack, and others may have strengths you don’t. Don’t focus so much on what you’re good at that you overlook your weaknesses. It’s important to recognize other people’s strengths and your own shortcomings.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shēn cái\" data-defn=\"stature / build (height and weight) / figure\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">身材</span><span class=\"tr\">身材</span><rt>shēn cái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gāo dà\" data-defn=\"tall; lofty; towering\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">高大</span><span class=\"tr\">高大</span><rt>gāo dà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"quán jī shǒu\" data-defn=\"boxer\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">拳击手</span><span class=\"tr\">拳擊手</span><rt>quán jī shǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qù\" data-defn=\"to go, to go to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fàn guǎn\" data-defn=\"restaurant\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">饭馆</span><span class=\"tr\">飯館</span><rt>fàn guǎn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chī fàn\" data-defn=\"to have a meal / to eat\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">吃饭</span><span class=\"tr\">吃飯</span><rt>chī fàn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tuō xià\" data-defn=\"to take off (clothing)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">脱下</span><span class=\"tr\">脫下</span><rt>tuō xià</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà yī\" data-defn=\"overcoat / topcoat / cloak\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">大衣</span><span class=\"tr\">大衣</span><rt>dà yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"guà\" data-defn=\"to hang; to suspend (from a hook etc) / to hang up (the phone) / (of a line) to be dead / to be worried; to be concerned / (dialect) to make a phone call / to register (at a hospital); to make an appointment (with a doctor) / (slang) to kill; to die; to be finished; to fail (an exam)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">挂</span><span class=\"tr\">掛</span><rt>guà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mén\" data-defn=\"gate / door / gateway / doorway / opening / valve / switch / way to do something / knack / family / house / (religious) sect / school (of thought) / class / category / phylum or division (taxonomy) / (suffix) -gate (i.e. scandal; derived from Watergate)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">门</span><span class=\"tr\">門</span><rt>mén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng\" data-defn=\"(noun suffix) on; above\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yīn wèi\" data-defn=\"because; owi